{"text": "If you still see your mother's name light up your phone, that is not ordinary. That is a blessing.\n\nIf your father still calls you, even for no reason at all, that is a blessing. If your brother or your sister sends you nonsense, jokes, small things that do not matter, that is life still reaching for you. If your grandparents still remember your name, your face, your voice \u2014 that is a quiet miracle.\n\nIf someone says, call me when you get home, they are telling you that your life matters to them. If someone prays for you when you are not in the room, that is protection you will never see.\n\nDo not rush past these moments. Do not let them become normal. Because one day the phone will be quiet. The messages will stop. The names will not appear again. And only then will you understand that these were never small things. They were the riches of a life.\n\nComment blessing, and I will send you what to do tonight.\n\nNoticing what you still have is where this begins. Holding on to it when the world is loud is the harder part. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "m", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", "'", "s", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "p", "h", "o", "n", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "o", "r", "d", "i", "n", "a", "r", "y", ".", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "b", "l", "e", "s", "s", "i", "n", "g", ".", "\n", "\n", "I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", ",", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "n", "o", " ", "r", "e", "a", "s", "o", "n", " ", "a", "t", " ", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s",